  "solution": "We apply each option on the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) ×, =, ̶ , ÷\n\n52 × 13 = 16 - __**32 ÷ 2\n\n52 **____**×**____** 13**__ = 16 - 16\n\n676 = __**16 - 16**__\n\n676 ≠ 0 \n\nOption 2) ÷, ×, =, ×\n\n__**52 ÷ 13**__ × 16 = 32 × 2\n\n__**4 ×**____** 16**__ = __**32 **____**×**____** 2**__\n\n64 = 64 \n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, =, ̶\n\n52 × __**13 ÷ 16**__ = 32 - 2\n\n__**52 × **____0.8__** = 32 - 2\n\n41.6 = __**32 -**____** 2**__\n\n41.6 ≠ 30\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, =, ̶\n\n__**52 ÷ 13**__ × 16 = 32 - 2\n\n__**4 ×**____** 16**__ = 32 - 2\n\n64 = __**32 -**____** 2**__\n\n64 ≠ 30\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2)**\n\n4",
